Scope
-----
This directory contains a SINGLE demonstration case, included so that the
reference implementation runs out of the box. The 50-case study dataset
described in the accompanying publication is not redistributed here.

Material was obtained in June 2024 under the licence terms then in force.
Radiopaedia introduced an application process for non-commercial AI-related
use on 6 December 2024; users intending new AI-related use of Radiopaedia
content should consult https://radiopaedia.org/licence directly.

data/case_schema.json is documentation authored for this repository and is
covered by the MIT licence in the repository root.
